  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-09-15T01:59:22.638Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, since the 5.6 launch, I've started having a issue with the weapons in the likes of Steel & Gold and CTF. Basically they just don't equip right. The second I pick up the gun it shoots and if I let go of the trigger it drops. You can probably guess what shooting is like in that case.\nFirst time it happened, just a quick restart of the game seemed to have fixed it but now it seems to be a almost permanent bug for me.\n\nI've yet to experience any similar issue in desktop mode as far as I can recall.",
